        <mxCell id="xy4e8WZACu6ul9L-bpD3-28" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;i style=&quot;font-size: 17px; text-align: left; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;For Structured Answer follow this flow:&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-size: 17px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Current Role&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-size: 17px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Total Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-size: 17px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Main Technical Skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-size: 17px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Current Project&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-size: 17px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-size: 17px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Reason for looking for a change&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="370" x="-20" y="2030" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xy4e8WZACu6ul9L-bpD3-29" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontStyle=2;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight:normal;&quot; id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-a5b19b38-7fff-e3f9-b291-b0f10ec6fa5a&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;I am currently working as a Data Engineer with three years of experience. My primary skills are SQL, Python, PySpark and Databricks. In my current project, I develop batch pipelines that ingest data from cloud storage, transform it using PySpark and load it into Delta tables. I am now looking for a role with more ownership and larger Data Engineering use cases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
